><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The illustrations have been made high-resolution, allowing you to experience the world of Enhanced, which has become even more beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras/CG_106A.png?t=1749549453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbOpening movie included</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully animated opening movie produced by P.A.WORKS has been added, and the theme song is &quot;GRAVITY ERROR&quot; (sung by Ayane)<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras/image_03.jpg?t=1749549453\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u203bOther features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbSteam Rankings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports Steam-specific internet rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faintia rankings have been implemented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim to become the best Faintia user in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras/\u30e9\u30f3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0_\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u524a\u9664.png?t=1749549453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbTraining mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbVertical screen support (arcade mode only)</strong></p>","developers":["Cosmo Machia inc."],"dlc":[3772940],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/576c2a704c5394bb5b02f1e1e25eec4e2e806c47/header.jpg?t=1749549453","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u201cTriggerHeart EXELICA ENHANCED\u201c\u3000\u00a9 Cosmo Machia Inc. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u